  ambiguous, invalid, malformed, timed-out, or unavailable model responses.
- Erase raw conversational values when an unconfirmed submission is rejected or corrected.

Validation:
- `.venv/bin/ruff check apps/api`: PASS.
- `.venv/bin/ruff format apps/api --check`: PASS, 39 files checked.
- `.venv/bin/pytest apps/api/tests`: PASS, 76 tests.
